msgid "Talk_Quest"
msgstr "Talk_Quest"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "176_Man in Black"
msgid "Have you reconsidered, Saejima-san?"
msgstr "¿Has cambiado de parecer, Saejima-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Saejima"
msgid "Sorry. Not interested. Find someone else."
msgstr "Lo lamento. No me interesa. Búscate a alguien más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Man in Black"
msgid "I really do think you'd find this job worth your while.\\r\nI'll be here if you change your mind."
msgstr "De verdad creo que este trabajo te viene como anillo al dedo.\\r\nEstaré por aquí si cambias de opinión."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Saejima"
msgid "I don't come cheap, y'know."
msgstr "No salgo barato, ¿sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Man in Black"
msgid "I understand. But I'm happy to hear you're interested."
msgstr "Comprendo. Pero me alegra oír que estés interesado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Takeda"
msgid "I'm Takeda, a manager at Oyamada Talent Productions.\\r\nLet's head to our office to discuss the particulars."
msgstr "Me llamo Takeda, soy un manager en Oyamada Talent Productions.\\r\nAcompañame a mi oficina para discutir los detalles."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Man in Black"
msgid "Excuse me, are you Saejima-san?"
msgstr "Perdona, ¿eres Saejima-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Saejima"
msgid "Who's askin'?"
msgstr "¿Quién pregunta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Man in Black"
msgid "A friend. I'm a respectable businessman, I assure you.\\r\nI've been looking for you."
msgstr "Un amigo. Me considero un hombre de negocios respetable, eso te lo garantizo.\\r\nLlevo tiempo buscándote."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Saejima"
msgid "How'd ya hear 'bout me, anyhow?"
msgstr "¿Cómo supiste sobre mí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Man in Black"
msgid "You can relax. I just happen to have some homeless men\\r\nin my circle of acquaintances."
msgstr "Puedes estar relajado. Resulta que tengo a unos cuantos sin techo\\r\nen mi lista de contactos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Man in Black"
msgid "I asked one if he knew anybody who could help me out,\\r\nand your name came up."
msgstr "Le pregunté a uno si conocía a alguien que me pudiera ayudar con algo,\\r\ny surgió tu nombre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Saejima"
msgid "Alright, then. So whaddya want?"
msgstr "Bueno, entonces. ¿Qué es lo que quieres?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Man in Black"
msgid "Actually, there's a little, uh, job I'd like you to do."
msgstr "De hecho, te tengo un pequeño, eh, trabajito con el que me gustaría que me ayudaras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Saejima"
msgid "A paying job?"
msgstr "¿Y ese trabajito es remunerado?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
msgctxt "392_Man in Black"
msgid "Yes. Can you spare a moment to hear more about it?"
msgstr "Claro que sí. ¿Me das un momento para explicártelo más a fondo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Saejima"
msgid "I don't come cheap, y'know."
msgstr "No salgo barato, ¿sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Man in Black"
msgid "I understand. But I'm happy to hear you're interested."
msgstr "Comprendo. Pero me alegra oír que estés interesado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Takeda"
msgid "I'm Takeda, a manager at Oyamada Talent Productions.\\r\nLet's head to our office to discuss the particulars."
msgstr "Me llamo Takeda, soy un manager en Oyamada Talent Productions.\\r\nAcompañame a mi oficina para discutir los detalles."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Saejima"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Man in Black"
msgid "I'd really like to discuss this opportunity with you.\\r\nMeet me here if you happen to change your mind."
msgstr "De verdad me encantaría discutir esta oportunidad contigo.\\r\nEstaré justo aquí por si cambias de parecer."

